#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[CoalPowerPlant01]"
msgstr "A power plant that burns coal to produce electricity. Fairly inexpensive to build and maintain, but generates lots of pollution.\r\nCan be upgraded with an additional turbine, enlarged coal storage, exhaust filter and an advanced furnace."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[RoadMaintenanceDepot01]"
msgstr "Base of operations for road maintenance personnel, their tools and vehicles. Road maintenance comprises road repairs, snow clearing, and traffic accident clean-up.\r\nCan be upgraded with an extra garage for a larger maintenance vehicle fleet."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[WindTurbine01]"
msgstr "Rotating blades combined with a turbine generate power from the wind. Power output is dependent on placement and weather conditions, but wind turbines generate no pollution.\r\nCan be upgraded with a storage battery, solar panels, and an advanced rotor design."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[SewageOutlet01]"
msgstr "A basic sewage processing facility that pumps waste water out into the environment.\r\nCan be upgraded with an additional settling tank and a chemical purification system."

#: en
msgid "Assets.NAME[Large Water Pipe]"
msgstr "Large Water Pipe"

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Large Water Pipe]"
msgstr "Single high capacity pipe for moving fresh water."

#: en
