msgstr "Large Sewage Pipe"

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Large Sewage Pipe]"
msgstr "Single high capacity pipe for moving sewage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.NAME[Combined Large Pipe]"
msgstr "Combined Large Pipe"

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Combined Large Pipe]"
msgstr "Dual high capacity pipes for moving fresh water and sewage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[MedicalClinic01]"
msgstr "Basic healthcare for a small area. Can pick up patients with ambulances. Helps citizens in its service area remain healthier.\r\nCan be upgraded with an ambulance depot and an extension wing."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Crematorium01]"
msgstr "Cremates the bodies of deceased citizens. The ashes do not take up space in the crematorium.\r\nCan be upgraded with a hearse garage, an additional incinerator, and an expanded refrigerator."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Landfill01]"
msgstr "Sends out garbage trucks to collect waste from the city and stores it in the designated area.\r\nCan be upgraded with a garbage truck depot, a hazardous waste collection point, and a waste recycling unit."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[IncinerationPlant01]"
msgstr "Collects and burns garbage, turning it into energy. This reduces garbage accumulation, but produces some air pollution.\r\nCan be upgraded with a garbage truck depot, an extra incinerator, and an extended storage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[RecyclingCenter01]"
msgstr "Collects and sorts garbage to produce reusable materials, which are then sold further. This produces income for the city.\r\nCan be upgraded with a garbage truck depot, a hazardous waste collection point, and an extended storage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Landfill Site Lot]"
msgstr "Adjusts the dumping area of a landfill. A larger area can store more garbage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[FireHouse01]"
msgstr "A small station that houses a few fire engines. Also reduces the likelihood of fires in the buildings in its service area by conducting safety supervision.\r\nCan be upgraded with an extended garage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[FireStation01]"
msgstr "A large station that houses several fire engines. Also reduces the likelihood of fires in the buildings in its service area by conducting safety supervision.\r\nCan be upgraded with an extended garage, a training facility, a disaster response unit, and a helipad that provides firefighting helicopters."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[EmergencyShelter01]"
msgstr "Provides citizens a safe place to stay during large-scale accidents or natural disasters.\r\nCan be upgraded with advanced air recycling and extra stores of consumables."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[PoliceStation01]"
msgstr "A base of operations for local police. Houses staff facilities, an attached garage for squad cars and a small jail.\r\nCan be upgraded with an extended garage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[PoliceHeadquarters01]"
msgstr "A large station house with administrative and staff facilities, a large garage and a jail.\r\nCan be upgraded with an extended garage,  extra jail cells, and a helipad that provides police helicopters."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[ElementarySchool01]"
msgstr "A place of basic education for children. Provides the first level of education. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extension wing, a children's clinic, and a playground."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[HighSchool01]"
msgstr "A school for teenagers. Provides the second level of education. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extension wing, a sports field, and a library."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[College01]"
msgstr "The first step towards higher education for teens and adults alike. Provides the third level of education. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extension wing, and a library."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[University01]"
msgstr "A massive complex that offers education for academically oriented citizens. Provides the fourth level of education. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extension wing, a library, and a park."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[BusDepot01]"
msgstr "Fuels, maintains and stores buses. Each vehicle stops by the depot at certain intervals to stay in running order. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extra garage and electric buses."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[TaxiDepot01]"
msgstr "A garage and repair workshop for taxis. Also houses a small dispatch office. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extra garage, a dispatch center, and electric taxis."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[TrainStation01]"
msgstr "Allows passengers train boarding and disembarking. \r\nCan be upgraded with extra platforms, station services, a subway interface and a taxi stop."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[CargoTrainTerminal01]"
msgstr "A large warehouse where cargo trains can load and unload cargo to and from trucks. \r\nCan be upgraded with a storage warehouse and extra tracks."

#: en
msgid "Assets.UPGRADE_NAME[RailYard01 Extra Rails]"
msgstr "Extra Tracks"

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[TramDepot01]"
msgstr "Workshops and staff facilities for the tram network. Trams return to the depot for maintenance at regular intervals. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extra garage."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[SubwayStation02]"
msgstr "Allows passengers subway train boarding and disembarking overground. \r\nCan be upgraded with station services."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[SubwayYard01]"
msgstr "Rail yard that contains warehouses and facilities for subway train handling and maintenance. \r\nCan be upgraded with extra tracks and a maintenance hall."

#: en
msgid "Assets.UPGRADE_NAME[SubwayYard01 Extra Rails]"
msgstr "Extra Tracks"

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[Harbor01]"
msgstr "Passenger ships stop here to load and unload. A passenger terminal allows passengers to board and disembark. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extra pier and a transit terminal."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[CargoHarbor01]"
msgstr "A harbor with cranes and container yards that allows for cargo ships to load and unload. Also stores the cargo until it is shipped forward.\r\nCan be upgraded with a railway connection, extra cargo cranes, and warehouses."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[PostOffice01]"
msgstr "Handles local incoming and outgoing mail. Post vans and trucks pick up mail from mailboxes around the city. Citizens can also drop off their mail directly at the office. \r\nCan be upgraded with an extra garage and a storage extension."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[PostSortingFacility01]"
msgstr "Processes and stores both local and intercity mail. Mail going to and coming from outside the city is carried by high capacity post trucks, which helps reduce mail related traffic on the roads. \r\nCan be upgraded with extra loading ramps, a storage extension and automated sorting systems."

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[RadioMast01]"
msgstr "Transmits mobile data, radio traffic and TV signals. In case of emergencies, the masts are used to broadcast an alarm which allows citizens to react to the event more rapidly. \r\nCan be upgraded with a wireless network antenna and increased bandwidth."

