#: en
msgid "Assets.NAME[RoyalPalmTree01]"
msgstr "Royal Palm Tree"

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[RoyalPalmTree01]"
msgstr "Royal palm trees are usually planted as ornamental trees and also used for lumber. They are native to Central America."

#: en
msgid "Assets.NAME[SylvesterPalmTree01]"
msgstr "Sylvester Palm Tree"

#: en
msgid "Assets.DESCRIPTION[SylvesterPalmTree01]"
msgstr "Sylvester palm trees are flowering trees that produce fruit which used to make beverages and fruit preserves. They are native to South Asia."

