#: en
msgid "Infoviews.INFOMODE_TOOLTIP[Education Coverage]"
msgstr "Elementary Schools provide a passive well-being bonus in their vicinity to families with children which affects their Happiness. Does not affect children’s ability to attend a school."

#: en
msgid "Infoviews.INFOMODE_TOOLTIP[Residential Buildings]"
msgstr "Residential buildings are divided into **single-household** and **multi-household** buildings. Detached houses have one household each, while row houses and apartment buildings contain multiple households. \r\nSingle household buildings generate less traffic, but are strongly affected by high **land value**, since the building upkeep cost falls on one family. \r\nLarge apartment buildings generate more traffic and **noise pollution**, but are less affected by high land value, since the building upkeep cost is divided between all the households in the building."

#: en
msgid "Infoviews.INFOMODE[Land Value Sources]"
msgstr "Land Value Sources"

#: en
msgid "Infoviews.INFOMODE_TOOLTIP[Land Value Sources]"
msgstr "Various buildings increase **Land value** in their vicinity. Land value in turn affects the development of zoned buildings."

