#: en
msgid "Infoviews.INFOMODE_TOOLTIP[Homeless]"
msgstr "Citizens can become **homeless** if they cannot afford rent, move out as adults from their parents’ home without finding a new home, or lose their home due to events or player actions.\r\n\r\nHomeless citizens find shelter in the city’s parks and other recreation buildings. Providing low-cost housing, such as medium-density and low-rent apartment buildings, helps homeless citizens to find new homes.\r\n\r\nIntercity **public transportation** gives homeless citizens the option to leave the city if they cannot find new homes."

