#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Out of Service]"
msgstr "Out of Service"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Out of Service]"
msgstr "The building becomes non-operational. Only maintenance personnel visit the building anymore, so upkeep cost, electricity and water consumption drop to a very low level."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Lot Parking Fee]"
msgstr "Parking Fee"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Lot Parking Fee]"
msgstr "A fee is charged for parking on this lot. The cost of parking can be adjusted with the slider."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Advanced Pollution Management]"
msgstr "Advanced Pollution Management"

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Recreational Use]"
msgstr "Recreational Use"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Recreational Use]"
msgstr "Increases the city attractiveness for adult tourists and increases the well-being of the residents in the affected area. "

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Fire Safety Sprinkler System]"
msgstr "Fire Safety Sprinkler System"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Fire Safety Sprinkler System]"
msgstr "Reduces the fire hazard of buildings in the affected area, but increases the level up cost."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Recycling]"
msgstr "Recycling"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Recycling]"
msgstr "Citizens in the area are encouraged to recycle. This will reduce the amount of used resources but decreases free time."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Roadside Parking Fee]"
msgstr "Roadside Parking Fee"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Roadside Parking Fee]"
msgstr "A fee is charged for parking on the roadside. The cost of parking can be adjusted with the slider."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Small Business Enthusiast]"
msgstr "Small Business Enthusiast"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Small Business Enthusiast]"
msgstr "Slightly reduces the tax paid by Low Density Businesses within the district."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Speed Bumps]"
msgstr "Speed Bumps"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Speed Bumps]"
msgstr "Reduces the speed of vehicles driving within the district. This lowers the chance of accidents and brings noise pollution down significantly."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Combustion Engine Ban]"
msgstr "Combustion Engine Ban"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Combustion Engine Ban]"
msgstr "Fuel burning vehicles are forbidden from entering unless they belong to district residents or businesses. This reduces noise and air pollution within the district. "

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Heavy Traffic Ban]"
msgstr "Heavy Traffic Ban"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Heavy Traffic Ban]"
msgstr "Trucks and other heavy vehicles are forbidden from entering the district. This reduces noise and air pollution and can help traffic congestion. Highways remain unaffected."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Gated Community]"
msgstr "Gated Community"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Gated Community]"
msgstr "Only people living or working within the district are allowed in. This increases the well-being of its residents and reduces crime in the area. Does not affect City Services."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[High-Speed Highways]"
msgstr "High-Speed Highways"

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Energy Consumption Awareness]"
msgstr "Energy Consumption Awareness"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Energy Consumption Awareness]"
msgstr "Citizens are advised to pay attention to their use of electronic devices. Electricity consumption is reduced by 5%."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Route Vehicle Count]"
msgstr "Vehicles"

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Route Ticket Price]"
msgstr "Ticket price"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Route Ticket Price]"
msgstr "Modify the line's ticket price."

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Route Vehicle Count]"
msgstr "Modify the number of vehicles on the line.\r\nNote that it takes a while for the new vehicles to be prepared in the depot before they are sent out."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[PreRelease Programs]"
msgstr "Pre-Release Programs"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[PreRelease Programs]"
msgstr "Prisoners are enrolled in educational programs before they are released from prison. This helps them integrate back into society and reduces the likelihood of committing crimes again."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[City Promotion]"
msgstr "City Promotion"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[City Promotion]"
msgstr "Advertising increases the city's Attractiveness, which brings in more tourists. This unfortunately also increases the crime rate around tourist attractions."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Paid Outside Services]"
msgstr "Import City Services"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Advanced Pollution Management]"
msgstr "Industrial filters reduce air and ground pollution of industrial zone buildings, but they will produce more garbage.\r\n- Air & Ground Pollution -25%\r\n- Garbage Accumulation +15%"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[High-Speed Highways]"
msgstr "Removes highway speed limits so all vehicles can drive their maximum speed. Also increases the probability of traffic accidents.\r\n- Traffic Accident Probability +10%"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Paid Outside Services]"
msgstr "The city imports city services from neighboring cities to either cover a missing city service or to assist the existing city services with more service vehicles. The imported service costs are based on the city's population and multiplied by every 1000 citizens.\r\n\r\nServices included: Police, Healthcare, Deathcare, Garbage Management and Fire and Rescue services."

#: en
msgid "Policy.TITLE[Taxi Starting Fee]"
msgstr "Taxi Base Fare"

#: en
msgid "Policy.DESCRIPTION[Taxi Starting Fee]"
msgstr "A base fare is applied to each taxi ride. This is added to the fare based on the actual distance traveled."

#: en
msgid "Progression.PANEL_TITLE"
msgstr "Progression"

#: en
msgid "Progression.PURCHASE_BUTTON_AVAILABLE"
msgstr "Purchase"

#: en
msgid "Progression.PURCHASE_BUTTON_MILESTONE"
msgstr "Requires milestone {MILESTONE}"

#: en
msgid "Progression.PURCHASE_BUTTON_POINTS"
msgstr "Not enough points"

#: en
msgid "Progression.PURCHASE_BUTTON_LOCKED"
msgstr "Requirements not met"

#: en
msgid "Progression.PURCHASE_BUTTON_UNLOCKED"
msgstr "Already unlocked"

#: en
msgid "Progression.INCLUDES_LABEL"
msgstr "Unlocks:"

#: en
msgid "Progression.PURCHASE_COST"
msgstr "Cost: {COST}"

#: en
msgid "Progression.BUILD_NOW_BUTTON"
msgstr "Build Now"

#: en
msgid "Progression.BUILD_LATER_BUTTON"
msgstr "Build Later"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[BasicRoadServiceNode]"
msgstr "Basic Road Services"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[BasicRoadServiceNode]"
msgstr "Basic road services provide the basic infrastructure for building a road network."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[LargeRoadsNode]"
msgstr "Large Roads"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[LargeRoadsNode]"
msgstr "Very wide, multi-lane roads that allow for high speeds and are good for areas that have a very high traffic demand."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[RoundaboutsNode]"
msgstr "Roundabouts"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[RoundaboutsNode]"
msgstr "Roundabouts are a handy alternative to regular intersections, and allow for traffic to flow more smoothly."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[ParkingAreasNode]"
msgstr "Parking Areas"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[ParkingAreasNode]"
msgstr "Cars need parking spaces, and areas of high activity can benefit from dedicated parking areas."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[HighwaysNode]"
msgstr "Highways"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[HighwaysNode]"
msgstr "These high-speed, high-capacity roads connect distant locations to each other and cities to outside connections. The high road speeds generate noise pollution and do not allow zoning around highways."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[AutomatedParkingBuildingNode]"
msgstr "Automated Parking Building"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[AutomatedParkingBuildingNode]"
msgstr "An automated parking garage that uses elevators to lift and stack vehicles in small slots on top of each other. This saves plenty of street level space."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[GrandBridgeNode]"
msgstr "Grand Bridge"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[GrandBridgeNode]"
msgstr "A magnificent bridge that will be a landmark of the city."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[BasicElectricityNode]"
msgstr "Basic Electricity Services"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[BasicElectricityNode]"
msgstr "Basic energy production facilities and network infrastructure."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[HydroelectricPowerPlantNode]"
msgstr "Hydroelectric Power Plant"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[GasPowerPlantNode]"
msgstr "Gas Power Plant"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[GasPowerPlantNode]"
msgstr "Gas-fired power plants provide the city with cost-effective large-scale energy solutions with moderate pollution emissions."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[GeothermalPowerPlantNode]"
msgstr "Geothermal Power Plant"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[WaveEnergyConverterNode]"
msgstr "Wave Energy Converter"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[WaveEnergyConverterNode]"
msgstr "Wave energy converters use the movement of waves to generate electricity. "

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[SolarPowerStationNode]"
msgstr "Solar Power Plant"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[NuclearPowerPlantNode]"
msgstr "Nuclear Power Plant"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[NuclearPowerPlantNode]"
msgstr "Nuclear power plants produce massive amounts of energy with minimal emissions. Their maintenance, however, is expensive and requires well-educated workers."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[LargeHadronColliderNode]"
msgstr "Large Hadron Collider"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[BasicWater&SewageNode]"
msgstr "Basic Water & Sewage Services"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[BasicWater&SewageNode]"
msgstr "Basic water and sewage services provide the city with the facilities and infrastructure for delivering freshwater and processing sewage."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[WaterReserveTanksNode]"
msgstr "Water Reserve Tanks"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[WaterReserveTanksNode]"
msgstr "Water reserve tanks are facilities that provide water supply during water shortages and peak use times."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[WaterTreatmentPlantNode]"
msgstr "Water Treatment Plant"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[WaterTreatmentPlantNode]"
msgstr "Water treatment is the processing and purification of wastewater. Treated water can be safely recirculated into the water network or disposed of in the environment."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[BasicHealthcareNode]"
msgstr "Basic Healthcare Services"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[CrematoriumNode]"
msgstr "Crematorium"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[CrematoriumNode]"
msgstr "Crematoriums cremate the bodies of deceased citizens. "

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[HospitalNode]"
msgstr "Hospital"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[HospitalNode]"
msgstr "Hospitals provide both basic healthcare as well as specialized treatment, which help citizens remain healthier."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[DiseaseControlCenterNode]"
msgstr "Disease Control Center"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[DiseaseControlCenterNode]"
msgstr "The study of pathogens, toxins, and hereditary diseases and ways to treat them helps citizens recover from even the most serious of conditions."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[HealthResearchInstituteNode]"
msgstr "Health Research Institute"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[HealthResearchInstituteNode]"
msgstr "The Health Research Institute studies ways of keeping citizens healthier and educates them in various ways via, for example, lectures and outdoor challenges."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[BasicGarbageManagementNode]"
msgstr "Basic Garbage Management Services"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[BasicGarbageManagementNode]"
msgstr "Basic garbage management provides the city with a landfill site that sends out garbage trucks to collect garbage from households, companies and services."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[IncineratorPlantNode]"
msgstr "Incinerator Plant"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[RecyclingCenterNode]"
msgstr "Recycling Center"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[RecyclingCenterNode]"
msgstr "The recycling center collects and sorts garbage to produce reusable materials. Selling the recycled materials creates additional income for the city."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[IndustrialWasteProcessingNode]"
msgstr "Industrial Waste Processing"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[IndustrialWasteProcessingNode]"
msgstr "The industrial waste processing facility collects and handles toxic waste products resulting from industrial production. As a result, the ground pollution produced by industrial buildings is lowered."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[BasicFire&RescueNode]"
msgstr "Basic Fire & Rescue Services"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[BasicFire&RescueNode]"
msgstr "Basic fire & rescue services provide the city with fire houses and fire engines, which are essential in various firefighting and rescue operations."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[FirewatchTowerNode]"
msgstr "Firewatch Tower"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[FirewatchTowerNode]"
msgstr "These towers keep a constant lookout and thus reduce the chance of a forest fire."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[FireStationNode]"
msgstr "Fire Station"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[FireStationNode]"
msgstr "Fire stations are larger fire houses that are better prepared in firefighting and rescue operations, and can cover a larger service area."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[EmergencyShelterNode]"
msgstr "Emergency shelters provide citizens a safe place to stay during large-scale accidents or natural disasters."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[EarlyDisasterWarningSystemNode]"
msgstr "Early Disaster Warning System"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[EarlyDisasterWarningSystemNode]"
msgstr "The EDWS contains multitudes of high-end detection systems that can spot approaching natural disasters in advance, reducing their impact on the city."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[LargeEmergencyShelterNode]"
msgstr "Large Emergency Shelter"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[LargeEmergencyShelterNode]"
msgstr "This massive shelter can house a significant number of citizens for an extended period of time during even the most dangerous disasters."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[BasicPolice&AdministrationNode]"
msgstr "Basic Police & Administration Services"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[BasicPolice&AdministrationNode]"
msgstr "Basic police & administration services provide the city with police stations and patrol cars."

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[WelfareOfficeNode]"
msgstr "Welfare Office"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[PoliceHeadquartersNode]"
msgstr "Police Headquarters"

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_DESCRIPTION[PoliceHeadquartersNode]"
msgstr "These large station houses have extended administrative and staff facilities, a jail and a large garage for patrol cars, so they can cover a larger service area. "

#: en
msgid "Progression.NODE_NAME[CityHallNode]"
msgstr "City Hall"

#: en
