msgstr "The citizen is unable to work, and may die if their condition doesn't improve."

#: en
msgid "SelectedInfoPanel.CITIZEN_CONDITION_DESCRIPTION[Injured]"
msgstr "The citizen is unable to work, and needs time to recover from their injuries."

