msgstr "The citizen's health is extremely low."

#: en
msgid "SelectedInfoPanel.CITIZEN_CONDITION_DESCRIPTION[InDistress]"
msgstr "The citizen is affected by a natural disaster. Their health and well-being decrease as long as they remain in the disaster area."

#: en
msgid "SelectedInfoPanel.CITIZEN_CONDITION_DESCRIPTION[Evacuated]"
msgstr "The citizen is in an emergency shelter. Their well-being decreases as long as they remain there, but will recover soon after they are able to leave the shelter."

