msgid "Tutorials.INTRO_TITLE"
msgstr "WELCOME"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.INTRO_SUBTITLE"
msgstr "to Cities: Skylines II!"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.INTRO"
msgstr "This is the place to build the city of your dreams! Take on in-depth challenges of managing city services and directing traffic flow, and follow the lives of your citizens.\r\n\r\nTutorials are here to guide you as you take your first steps towards building a city. As you progress, more hints and guidance become available in case you need it."

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.BEGIN_WITH_TUTORIALS"
msgstr "Let's build!"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.ENABLE_TUTORIALS_CONFIRM"
msgstr "Start the game with tutorials"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.BEFORE_STARTING"
msgstr "Before you start, let's look at how to move about your landscape by using **Camera Controls.**\r\n\r\nIf at any time you feel like turning the **Tutorials off or on** again, you can do so from the **Pause Menu,** the **gear icon** located in the top right corner.\r\n\r\nIn the pause menu you can also save your game and adjust all types of game settings."

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.BEFORE_STARTING_CONFIRM"
msgstr "Let's get to work"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TODO_INTRO"
msgstr "**Great job!** \r\nYou are now ready to start your first city.\r\n\r\nTo guide you through your steps, we have prepared a **Task List** for you. **Start a task by selecting play** and complete the steps to unlock the feature.\r\n\r\nYou will also see **Hints** along the way. They point out useful information.\r\n\r\nYou can proceed at your own pace, and revisit any completed task by selecting play again.\r\n\r\n**Start your first task!**"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TODO_INTRO_CONFIRM"
msgstr "OK"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TITLE[TutorialsIntroList]"
msgstr "How To Build a City"

