msgstr "Bulldozer"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[IntroductionTutorial]"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[ImportingAssetsTutorial]"
msgstr "Importing Assets"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[ModifyingTerrainTutorial]"
msgstr "Modifying Terrain"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[AddingObjectsTutorial]"
msgstr "Adding Objects"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[EditorPhotoModeTutorial]"
msgstr "Photo Mode"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[BulldozerTutorial]"
msgstr "Bulldozer"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[MapSettingsTutorial]"
msgstr "Map Settings"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[ClimateTutorial]"
msgstr "Climate"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[WaterTutorial]"
msgstr "Water"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[ResourcesTutorial]"
msgstr "Resources"

#: en
msgid "EditorTutorials.TITLE[ObjectsTutorial]"
msgstr "Objects"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TITLE[RoadsTutorialTwoLaneRoadGamepad]"
msgstr "Two-lane Road"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.DESCRIPTION[RoadsTutorialTwoLaneRoadGamepad]"
msgstr "The Two-lane Road is a basic road with two lanes, one in each direction, with street lamps on one side. \r\n\r\nIt is easy to build with, but it can only support a low amount of traffic.\r\n\r\n**When selecting a road, keep an eye on the information panel.**\r\nIt will show you how much the road costs to build and maintain, and how much electricity the built-in utility network can handle."

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TITLE[ElectricityFlowTutorialIntro]"
msgstr "Electricity Info View"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.DESCRIPTION[ElectricityFlowTutorialIntro]"
msgstr "**Electricity info view shows an overlay of electricity flow throughout the city, to help you spot weaknesses and solve problems.**\r\n\r\nElectricity panel also shows detailed information about the performance of the electricity grid, conditions that affect it and where your electricity plants are located."

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TITLE[ElectricityTutorialOutside]"
msgstr "Importing Electricity"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TITLE[ElectricityTutorialWind]"
msgstr "Wind Power"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TITLE[RoadsToolOptionsTutorial]"
msgstr "Road Tool Options"

#: en
msgid "Tutorials.TODO_OUTRO"
msgstr "Well Done!\r\n\r\nYou have completed your tasks and now have the basic knowledge of how to build a city.\r\n\r\nGoing forward, more tutorials and hints will pop up to guide you on your way.\r\n\r\nIf you feel like you no longer need the guidance, **you can turn tutorials off in the pause menu.**\r\n\r\nYou can always review old tutorials by **accessing the Advisor in the top right corner.**\r\n\r\n\r\n**Would you like to continue building this city or start a new one?**"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.WHATS_NEW"
msgstr "Whats new"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P1_HEADER"
msgstr "New Waterfront Zone"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P1_TITLE"
msgstr "A Slice of Paradise"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P1_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "New Waterfront Zone for European Theme gives your city a touch of Southern European coastal city charm, and \r\nNew iconic fences around the yards help tie the buildings together with the region's style.\r\n\r\nNew Waterfront Zone for the North American Theme brings an atmosphere of the Florida coastline to your cities, and new swimming pools in the backyards liven up the neighborhoods. "

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P2_HEADER"
msgstr "New Residential Signature Buildings"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P2_TITLE"
msgstr "Luxury Lifestyle"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P2_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "North American signature buildings take inspiration from the sun-kissed Florida beaches and villas. \r\n\r\nSpanish styled villas can be found from the European themed signature buildings. \r\nAll these new luxurious signature buildings are sure way to increase the sunshine in your city!"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P3_HEADER"
msgstr "New Vegetation"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P3_TITLE"
msgstr "It's time to face the palm trees!"

#: en
msgid "WhatsNew.BEACH_PROPERTIES_P3_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "In the Vegetation menu is a collection of new Palm Trees to bring a cool ocean breeze and relaxed beach vibes to your city!"

